{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301291","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301291","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430129101:1":{"text":"아직 구체적인 금액은 생각해각두지 않았어... 그냥 공방 하나 차릴 정도로?","source_cn":"具体多少钱我没想过……总之我攒下的钱得能够开一家工坊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94F08F1721E79BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430129102:1":{"text":"그럼 이 어두운 광산에서 나가서 내 공방에서 무기를 두드리면서 노래를 불러야지...","source_cn":"到时候我就可以离开这些矿洞，在自己的工坊边敲武器边哼歌……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C23100C8A1B2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430129103:1":{"text":"그날이 조금이라도 더 빨리 오려면 지금 열심히 캐야해!","source_cn":"为了那天早点到来，我得努力挖矿攒钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE30F73F440400D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矿工奥多":{"text":"광부 오드","source":"矿工奥多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}